notes               = "Merged (July 2026) with `jungle-refuge`, a duplicate of this poem created by the pages 61-69 bulk import, which did not dedupe against the file already in the repo. Ben's finished ===translation=== here is untouched. The Persian, machine pass, lantern and footnotes come from the import. That import had also staged an agent rendering in ===translation===, which per CLAUDE.md is Ben's slot alone; that rendering is now this file's ===lantern===, and the import's earlier, rougher lantern is superseded (kept in git history). The import's Persian is the better text — the older file read نمناران, a corruption of بمباران ('bombardment'). Note also a date disagreement the merge cannot settle: the older file's dateline read ۱۳۶۷/۲/۱۹ and the import's ۱۳۶۷/۲/۱۶; neither is photograph-verified, and the import's is taken here because it comes from the transcription. Worth checking against page 61."
